The Portal is permanently unlocked after Keymaster Y is defeated in the [[Grasslands]]. This hub provides immediate access to [[Ascension]], [[Raids]], [https://idle-skilling.fandom.com/wiki/Asylum Asylum], [[Purgatory]], [https://idle-skilling.fandom.com/wiki/Dairy_Aisle Dairy Aisle] and [[Mastery]], but access to [[Secrets]] will become available after they are unlocked. Once secrets are unlocked, their unique worlds will loop between each other within their respective portal.


